  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Incoming visit organic seed registration</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project entails an incoming visit of the Ukrainian working team to the Netherlands, organised by the incoming visitors programme of the RVO. The visit aims to share Dutch best practices regarding organic seed registration with the Ukrainian implementing team so that they could use this information while formulating and implementing technical extensions of the new legislation on organic seed registration.</narrative>
  </description>
